[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0010","text":"翻开题目卡，围绕该话题进行讨论\n——这次的卡片是……『洗澡』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0020","text":"说到洗澡，就是先洗哪里那种？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0030","text":"那种的不行——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0040","text":"关于洗澡要聊什么……\n有什么呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0050","text":"洗澡……浴缸……\n洗发水……淋浴……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0060","text":"啊，说起来\n之前去的澡堂里浮着好多小鸭子～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0070","text":"小鸭子……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0080","text":"那……我也好想埋在里面啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0090","text":"太棒了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_02_0100","text":"诶，哪家澡堂？\n下次大家一起去吧————？"}]
